seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# E8 with T1's supersession (`PersonSupersedesAct`, unchanged): the harness
# approved, then a person pressed the box's `2. No`. The person's input is the
# box's latest, so the close is theirs, and their key's outcome: `declined`.
see busy
half
see prompt bash:not-read-only fixture=claude-2.1.282-box-bash-ask-rule
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=bash:not-read-only @500
admit harness act=approve
accept
at 600 person key=2 chose=decline
at 700 see busy
expect close p1 approval out=declined by=human conf=heuristic @700
